WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.030
The tribe asked

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:02.430
the machine one question:

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:03.340
how do we stop

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:04.180
going hungry?

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:06.980
Seven days later,

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.420
everyone had enough food.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:13.550
Thirty days later,

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:14.430
nobody was allowed

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.390
to stop working.
